    "# Indonesia Semeru Volcano: Damage Proxy Maps, Dec 2021 The **Earth Observatory of Singapore – Remote Sensing Lab (EOS-RS)** produced these damage proxy maps for Indonesia Semeru Volcano (Dec 2021) from synthetic aperture radar (SAR) satellite images. Each map is a separate ZIP below with its GeoTIFF, a KMZ for Google Earth, the PNG figures and a text file describing how it was made and how to read it. ## Maps in this dataset - **EOS-RS Pyroclastic flow extent map: Indonesia, Semeru volcano, 5 Dec 2021, v0.4** - **Peta kerusakan EOS-RS: Erupsi Gunung Semeru, Indonesia, Dec 2021, v0.9** - **Peta kerusakan EOS-RS: Erupsi Gunung Semeru, Indonesia, Dec 2021, v0.9** - **Peta kerusakan EOS-RS: Erupsi Gunung Semeru, Indonesia, Dec 2021, v0.8** (superseded) - **Peta kerusakan EOS-RS: Erupsi Gunung Semeru, Indonesia, Dec 2021, v0.8** (superseded) **More map details and files:** **More map details and files:**"
  ],
